---
layout: blank
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- 301 for links that never change (old paths, profile short links),
    302 (the default) for links whose target changes, such as /location.
    Each rule also covers the trailing-slash form, so /linktree/ redirects like /linktree
    instead of serving the meta-refresh fallback page. #}
{%- for redirect in redirects %}
/{{ redirect.slug | safe }} {{ redirect.destination | safe }} {{ redirect.status or 302 }}
{%- if not ('*' in redirect.slug) and not ('.' in redirect.slug) %}
/{{ redirect.slug | safe }}/ {{ redirect.destination | safe }} {{ redirect.status or 302 }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
